    "site_desc": "Located in a crop field setting. It is very flat and open, at the edge of a crop field. Obstructions within 100m include high crops. The soil type is Honeoye silt loam.  This site is a part of the New York State Mesonet Flux Network, one of multiple subnetworks (e.g. Profiler, Snow) operated by the New York State Mesonet. It also operates as a Standard meteorological site.",
